0-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__mdna__0002", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.629, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__mdna__0003", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.5213, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__risk_factors__0010", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "risk_factors", "score": 0.6422, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}], "collapsed_near_duplicates": 17, "dropped_candidates": 258, "token_estimate": 31821, "gaps": [], "degraded": []}, "answer": {"direct_answer": "All three are large U.S.-based retailers built around low prices, but they differ in model and scale. Walmart is a people-led, technology-powered omni-channel retailer serving approximately 270 million customers each week across more than 10,750 stores in 19 countries [WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000]. Target operates as a single segment offering fashionable, differentiated merchandise and everyday essentials, with nearly all sales generated in the U.S. [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0000] [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0017]. Costco runs membership warehouses and e-commerce sites with 914 warehouses at August 31, 2025 and a limited selection of fewer than 4,000 active SKUs per warehouse [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0000] [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0002]. Fiscal periods differ: Walmart fiscal 2025 ended January 31, 2025, Target fiscal 2025 ended February 1, 2025, and Costco fiscal 2025 ended August 31, 2025.", "company_findings": [{"ticker": "WMT", "company": "Walmart Inc", "findings": [{"point": "Walmart has three reportable segments (Walmart U.S., Walmart International, Sam's Club U.S.) and competes via EDLP and EDLC pricing and cost philosophies.", "citations": ["WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Walmart U.S. had net sales of $462.4 billion for fiscal 2025 (ended January 31, 2025), 69% of consolidated net sales; Walmart International had $121.9 billion (18%).", "citations": ["WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0003", "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0007"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Sam's Club U.S. is a membership-only club with 600 clubs and net sales of $90.2 billion for fiscal 2025 (ended January 31, 2025), and Walmart is expanding into advertising, marketplace, fulfillment and financial services.", "citations": ["WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0010", "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0015"], "unverified": false}]}, {"ticker": "TGT", "company": "Target Corporation", "findings": [{"point": "Target's purpose is to help all families discover the joy of everyday life, and it operates as a single segment serving guests in stores and digital channels.", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0000"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Stores fulfilled more than 96 percent of total Merchandise Sales in each of the last three years, and about one-third of Merchandise Sales come from owned and exclusive brands.", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0003", "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0009"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Other revenue sources include Roundel advertising, Target Circle Card profit sharing and the Target Plus marketplace; net sales were $106.6 billion in the 52 weeks of fiscal 2025 (ended February 1, 2025).", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0011", "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0004"], "unverified": false}]}, {"ticker": "COST", "company": "Costco Wholesale Corporation", "findings": [{"point": "Costco operates membership warehouses and e-commerce sites on the concept that low prices on a limited selection will produce high sales volumes and rapid inventory turnover.", "citations": ["COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0001"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Total paid members were 81,000 thousand at fiscal 2025 (ended August 31, 2025), and Executive members represented approximately 73.6% of worldwide net sales.", "citations": ["COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0006", "COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0005"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Gasoline represented approximately 10% and e-commerce approximately 7% of total net sales in fiscal 2025 (ended August 31, 2025); Costco names Walmart and Target among its significant competitors.", "citations": ["COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0003", "COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0010"], "unverified": false}]}], "comparison_table": {"columns": ["Company", "Model", "Footprint", "Membership/loyalty", "Fiscal period end"], "rows": [["Walmart", "Omni-channel; 3 segments; EDLP/EDLC [WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000]", "10,750+ stores, 19 countries [WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000]", "Walmart+ and Sam's Club [WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0010]", "January 31, 2025"], ["Target", "Single segment; stores as fulfillment hubs [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0003]", "Nearly all sales in the U.S. [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0017]", "Target Circle; Circle 360 paid option [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0011]", "February 1, 2025"], ["Costco", "Membership warehouses; limited SKUs [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0002]", "914 warehouses worldwide [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0000]", "Paid members 81,000 thousand [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0006]", "August 31, 2025"]]}, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000", "claim": "Walmart omni-channel scale and EDLP", "quote": "serve approximately 270 million customers who visit more than 10,750 stores and numerous eCommerce websites in 19 countries"}, {"chunk_id": "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0003", "claim": "Walmart U.S. net sales and share", "quote": "net sales of $462.4 billion for fiscal 2025, representing 69% of our fiscal 2025 consolidated net sales"}, {"chunk_id": "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0007", "claim": "Walmart International net sales", "quote": "net sales of $121.9 billion for fiscal 2025, representing 18% of our fiscal 2025 consolidated net sales"}, {"chunk_id": "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0010", "claim": "Sam's Club membership-only, net sales", "quote": "Sam's Club U.S. is a membership-only club that operates 600 clubs"}, {"chunk_id": "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0015", "claim": "Ecosystem expansion", "quote": "Expanding our ecosystem and the products and services we offer in areas such as digital advertising, marketplace and fulfillment services"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0000", "claim": "Target single segment and purpose", "quote": "We operate as a single segment designed to enable guests to purchase products seamlessly in stores or through our digital channels."}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0003", "claim": "Stores as fulfillment hubs", "quote": "stores fulfilling more than 96 percent of total Merchandise Sales in each of the last three years"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0009", "claim": "Owned and exclusive brands", "quote": "Approximately one-third of our Merchandise Sales come from our owned and exclusive brands"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0011", "claim": "Other revenue sources and loyalty", "quote": "Roundel, which provides advertising services to vendors and other third parties"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0004", "claim": "Target net sales